-2027-selon_OKUQ7CKO6BBAVHU4M34Z36KCFU/" class="link"><p class="subtitle">Situation hydrique: la station de dessalement de Casablanca opérationnelle en février 2027, selon Nizar Baraka</p></a></div></div></div><div style="display:none" id="f0fcIyH3o8w11B6" data-fusion-collection="features" data-fusion-type="comments/default" data-fusion-name="fr-comments" data-fusion-message="Could not render component [features:comments/default]"></div></div></section><section class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-xl-3 col-lg-3 layout-section right-rail-section"><div class="advanced-grid-1 layout-section"><div class="c-stack b-single-chain" data-style-direction="vertical" data-style-justification="start" data-style-alignment="unset" data-style-inline="false" data-style-wrap="nowrap"><div class="c-stack b-single-chain__children-stack" data-style-direction="vertical" data-style-justification="start" data-style-alignment="unset" data-style-inline="false" data-style-wrap="nowrap"><div style="display:none" id="f0fWVo4MxUDr9wj" data-fusion-collection="features" data-fusion-type="ad/default" data-fusion-name="Ads 300x250" data-fusion-message="Could not render component [features:ad/default]"></div><div class="top360-block"><div class="line"></div><p class="block-title top360-block-title">Articles les plus lus</p><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3 col-xl-3 top360-item"><a href="/politique/foreign-policy-pourquoi-la-restitution-de-sebta-et-melilla-au-maroc-est-ineluctable_VRRCTSZ4SBERLEEVSJJEGNLILU/" class="top360-item-container"><div class="top360-item-index">1</div><div><div class="top360-item-title">Foreign Policy: pourquoi la restitution de Sebta (et Melilla) au Maroc est inéluctable</div></div></a></div><div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3 col-xl-3 top360-item"><a href="/sports/botola-a-20-clubs-apres-certains-presidents-et-entraineurs-lumfp-soutient-a-son-tour-un-projet-sans_E3NWD22EO5C33GBL72QIZW5UHA/" class="top360-item-container"><div class="top360-item-index">2</