curitaires multiplient les opérations coup de poing. Entre descentes sur le terrain, à l’image des récentes saisies à Marrakech, et traque cybernétique des pages clandestines sur les réseaux sociaux, la riposte s’organise pour stopper un marché noir qui met directement en danger la vie des consommateurs. Cet article est une revue de presse tirée du quotidien Assabah."},"display_date":"2026-08-16T19:46:36.858Z","distributor":{"mode":"reference","reference_id":"ee9cefa1-de4c-4a38-9f11-313a42dd5bd7"},"headlines":{"basic":"Saisie massive de stimulants sexuels: la traque des vendeurs clandestins s’intensifie sur le terrain et le web","meta_title":"","mobile":"","native":"","print":"","table":"","tablet":"","web":""},"label":{"afficher_le_chapo_sur_mobile":{"display":true,"text":"Non","url":""},"papier_urgent":{"display":true,"text":"Non","url":""}},"language":"FR","owner":{"sponsored":false},"promo_items":{"basic":{"_id":"RVWZGUGZVZHMFHVENJAXVRIXIQ","additional_properties":{"fullSizeResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/RVWZGUGZVZHMFHVENJAXVRIXIQ.jpg?auth=369a901ea0783b867af6db7432afe99c2ac279b6219663a6b1f51ab201b5db55","galleries":[],"mime_type":"image/jpeg","originalName":"viagra.jpg","originalUrl":"https://cloudfront-eu-central-1.images.arcpublishing.com/le360/RVWZGUGZVZHMFHVENJAXVRIXIQ.jpg","proxyUrl":"/resizer/v2/RVWZGUGZVZHMFHVENJAXVRIXIQ.jpg?auth=369a901ea0783b867af6db7432afe99c2ac279b6219663a6b1f51ab201b5db55","published":true,"resizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/RVWZGUGZVZHMFHVENJAXVRIXIQ.jpg?auth=369a901ea0783b867af6db7432afe99c2ac279b6219663a6b1f51ab201b5db55","restricted":false,"thumbnailResizeUrl":"/resizer/v2/RVWZGUGZVZHMFHVENJAXVRIXIQ.jpg?auth=369a901ea0783b867af6db7432afe99c2ac279b6219663a6b1f51ab201b5db55&width=300","version":8},"address":{},"auth":{"1":"369a901ea0783b867af6db7432afe99c2ac279b6219663a6b1f51ab201b5db55"},"copyright":"DR","created_date":"2022-11-27T03:49:20Z","credits":{"affiliation":[{"name":"DR","type":"author"}],"by":[]},"height":350,"last_updated_date":"2023-01